  "tinai": "unknown",
  "sangamTamil": "கோதை யருவிக் குளர்வரை நன்னாட\nபேதையொடு யாதும் உரையற்க - பேதை\nஉரைக்கிற் சிதைந்துரைக்கும் ஒல்லும் வகையான்\nவழக்கிக் கழிதலே நன்று.",
  "urai": null,
  "english": "Don't argue with the foolish. Lord of the pleasant land, where down the cool mountains the streams fall as garlands!— With a fool hold no converse. If you speak with him, in replying he will pervert your words. To slip away from him as best you can is well.",
